{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4164030/extras/e961674643258bb3f96c0f5cb83410f2.avif?t=1773976993\" alt=\"About the Game\" width=800 height=240 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Super\u00a0Climb\u00a0Up </strong>has\u00a0returned! Electric\u00a0Prune\u00a0Juice's 2019\u00a0NES-inspired\u00a0climbing\u00a0platformer is fully remastered\u00a0and expanded!\u00a0We've\u00a0improved\u00a0the\u00a0graphics,\u00a0the\u00a0player\u00a0movement and gameplay,\u00a0the\u00a0overall\u00a0presentation, added many new levels, and even an entirely new game mode! The original game featured 69 levels total, and we've expanded that total to 185!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get ready to explore with Natalie and Poppy, as they climb mountains, break blocks, and find hidden food! Plus, after you've explored all five parks, this time there's even more to experience afterwards! Will they be able to protect the parks from disaster...?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4164030/extras/e2cee18c2290c6eee78f9567bc99eb23.avif?t=1773976993\" alt=\"Features\" width=800 height=240 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >75 main stages, across five different parks</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >15\u00a0 bonus stages, for extra good climbers who manage to collect all the food and clear stages quickly!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Two extra post game worlds, including one following the events of <strong>Pizza Time Explosion</strong>!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A post game mode revisiting the main 75 levels with a new story and gameplay spin, and many interesting weapons and gameplay modifiers to unlock and play with, even in the main game levels!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Two playable characters to pick from</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Full controller support</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4164030?t=1773976993","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4164030/eaa4e72739717d5a1c6591a52c511ff345799786/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1773976993","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4164030/3c81b4fe6b8003379eaa54ca1a0d74493828bc10/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1773976993","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4164030/3c81b4fe6b8003379eaa54ca1a0d74493828bc10/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1773976993","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4164030/extras/e961674643258bb3f96c0f5cb83410f2.avif?t=1773976993\" alt=\"About the Game\" width=800 height=240 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Super\u00a0Climb\u00a0Up </strong>has\u00a0returned! Electric\u00a0Prune\u00a0Juice's 2019\u00a0NES-inspired\u00a0climbing\u00a0platformer is fully remastered\u00a0and expanded!\u00a0We've\u00a0improved\u00a0the\u00a0graphics,\u00a0the\u00a0player\u00a0movement and gameplay,\u00a0the\u00a0overall\u00a0presentation, added many new levels, and even an entirely new game mode! The original game featured 69 levels total, and we've expanded that total to 185!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get ready to explore with Natalie and Poppy, as they climb mountains, break blocks, and find hidden food! Plus, after you've explored all five parks, this time there's even more to experience afterwards! Will they be able to protect the parks from disaster...?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4164030/extras/e2cee18c2290c6eee78f9567bc99eb23.avif?t=1773976993\" alt=\"Features\" width=800 height=240 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >75 main stages, across five different parks</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >15\u00a0 bonus stages, for extra good climbers who manage to collect all the food and clear stages quickly!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Two extra post game worlds, including one following the events of <strong>Pizza Time Explosion</strong>!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A post game mode revisiting the main 75 levels with a new story and gameplay spin, and many interesting weapons and gameplay modifiers to unlock and play with, even in the main game levels!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Two playable characters to pick from</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Full controller support</p></li></ul>","developers":["Electric Prune Juice"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4164030/9c420a20abbf57fe4b2cee43526d3198615a5348/header.jpg?t=1773976993","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"\"Super Climb Up!!\" game software is \u00a9 2025 Electric Prune Juice, All Rights Reserved","linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4164030/1837972853/5db8a3ee69b99a5cb8da4b6a4af98423f04f92fb/1762594407/dash_av1.mpd?t=1762813447","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4164030/1837972853/5db8a3ee69b99a5cb8da4b6a4af98423f04f92fb/1